@module enemies
$A9B6 c AbsDiffBelow ; Carry when |E - D| is under A
> In: A the limit, D and E the two values. Out: A = |E - D|, carry set when it is under the limit. It stores the
> limit into its own compare at AbsDiffLimit $A9BF. Used for the distances between the hero and an actor (reach,
> pick-up) by the strikeable actors, the fragments and the routines of the other modules.
> Stage 1's AbsDiffBelow at $A7B8 is the same code.
> Witness: L1 1760 (rzx-r3).
