> Read by SetActorFrame `$AC0A` after the CALL at `$A9FF`.
$AA06 c ShatterActor ; Burst the actor into eight fragments and remove it
> IY = the actor. B = its column, C = its line rounded down to 8, +5; SpawnFragments $AA49 with D = 8, then
> RemoveActor $B3F8.
