$AA19 c InStrikeReach ; Z when the actor IY stands where the hero's strike lands
> The actor's column must be the hero's column $74E0 + 2 when the hero faces right ($74E9 bit 7 clear), - 2 when
> he faces left, and its line within 24 ($18) of the hero's line $74E1 (AbsDiffBelow $A9B6). Out: Z (ReturnZ
> $B37A) in reach, NZ (ReturnNZ $B37F) not.
> Stage 1's InStrikeReach at $A816, the same instructions; the operands that differ: the reach, 2 columns here (SUB 2 at $AA26, ADD 2 at $AA30; stage 1: 3), and the addresses of AbsDiffBelow, ReturnZ and ReturnNZ ($AA3E, $AA43, $AA46).
