$AA7E c InitFragment ; Fill the actor record IY as a fragment and run its first step
> Copies the fragment template $9CA6 into the record (InitActor $A6AF with D, E the column and line), then the
> record's +9 = A (facing), +$0A = B (the arc), +8 = C (the speed in pixels a step), and goes on into FragmentActor.
