$AB82 c MoveFragment ; Move the fragment E pixels across and point it at its pre-shifted image
> IY = the fragment, E = the pixels (negated when it faces left, +9 bit 7). The pixel column (+0 x 8 + the
> sub-column +$0D) moves by E; +0 and +$0D take the new column and pixel. The image pointer +4/+5 = $E8F8 + $21 x
> the shift (Multiply $89C5; the shift is the pixel, or 7 - the pixel when it faces left): eight pre-shifted copies
