$ADE3 c HeroUpdate ; The hero's pass: items, hazards, weapons, colour, then his state's handler
> IY = the hero. DrainItemCharge `$8860` and the three checks DragonFireDamage `$8807`, CheckWaterDeath `$8824` and PyreFireDamage `$87ED`. A column of 0 or `$20` and up costs a life (LoseLife `$7EB3`) unless he is dying (state `$0F`); stage 3 has no deadly-cell test here (stage 1's tested bit 3 of the cell under him). Then the selected item's kind (GetSelectedItem `$7EEA`) fires its weapon: 5 ThrowAmmo `$AE94`, 8 ThrowItem `$9646`, 7 FireBolt `$969A` (A is not kept between the tests). Dying: the death pause (RespawnCountdown `$95DA`). Then the colour (HeroColour `$AE59`), and while HeroFreeze `$FE60` counts down the controls are ignored. Else by the state +$0A: 0 HeroStand `$AEDA`, 1 HeroWalk `$AFED`, 2 HeroJump `$B11B`, 3 HeroFall `$B0B3`, 4 HeroLeapBack `$B0FF`, 6 HeroStrike `$AF61`, 9 HeroLeap `$B147`, `$0B` HeroRecoil `$85D7`; stage 3 has no states 5 and 7 (stage 1's middle and low strikes).
