@res stage3/bitmaps-lightning-3-2x72.bin
$C315 b LightningBolt4 3 ; The longest lightning bolt: 3 bytes x 104 lines
@res stage3/bitmaps-lightning-4-3x104.bin
$C44D b ThronePicture 16 ; The seated figure of the castle hall (grid 2): a row-packed picture of 79 lines (each a byte LEN x 16 + SKIP, then LEN bytes), drawn at buffer line $F8 of character row 3 ($5F18)
> The grid-2 picture code ($9514, called every pass from MainLoop) draws it with DrawRowPicture $89A4 while the figure stands (the hits counter $FE65 under $1E), then paints its colours ThroneAttributes. Read in rzx-r3 (all 335 bytes; s3-right never reaches the castle).
